 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Flames — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>Beginning 3rd level, with a better understanding of the flames you possess, you can now create volcanoes. As an action for 2 Cursed Energy per volcano, you can create a number of volcanoes up to your Cursed Energy modifier within 60 ft of you, with each volcano occupying a 5 ft circle. As a bonus action, you can force every creature in a 30 ft long and 5 ft wide line originating from each volcano to make a Dexterity saving throw as the volcanoes erupt and disappear. On a failure, they take Xd10 fire damage equal to proficiency and become restrained by the magma for 1 minute. On success, they take half as much damage and are not restrained. The creature can make a Strength saving throw at the beginning of their turns, ending the condition early on success. Any area targeted by this feature becomes difficult terrain.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
